{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Catch\/sink(receiveCompletion:receiveOutput:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Catch"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Starts processing the elements of this async sequence, handling output and completion events,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and returns an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnyCancellable"},{"type":"text","text":" token that can be used to cancel the subscription."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sink","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"receiveCompletion","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences","text":"AsyncSequences","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/AsyncSequences\/Completion","text":"Completion","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Afluent14AsyncSequencesO10CompletionO"},{"text":"<any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP"},{"text":">) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")? = nil, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"receiveOutput","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind"